message: "Working draft. If you refer to this work, please cite it as below and contact the authors before circulating."
title: "Multinational Ownership, Market Power, and the Measurement of Foreign Profits"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Velásquez Palacios"
    given-names: "Sebastián"
    affiliation: "Inter-American Development Bank"
  - family-names: "Volpe Martincus"
