year: 2026
url: "https://github.com/jsvp97/IADB_Orbis_DNB_Customs_Model"
abstract: >-
  A general-equilibrium model of multinational production with large firms
  (owner-level markups), firm-level ownership, and endogenous entry, with
  uniqueness theorems, a computer-assisted continuum certificate for the wage
  layer, and six stylized facts measured in matched Orbis/D&B-customs data
  for ten Latin American origin countries.
